## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-time, multi-tenant isolation, scalable compute, and precise cost accounting under burst, using Azure services.

## Key Concepts
- tenant isolation via Cosmos partitions and network policies
- ingress-budget checks with Redis as fast quota cache
- KEDA autoscaling on AKS for per-tenant workloads
- end-to-end latency, backpressure, and auditability

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo gateway budget check (high level)
async function handleEvent(event) {
  const budget = await redis.get(event.tenantId);
  if (budget <= 0) throw new Error('Budget exhausted');
  await redis.decr(event.tenantId, event.cost);
  forwardToTenantCompute(event);
}
```

